    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαμφοτερίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make ambiguous,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξημφοτέρικεν τὸν λόγον</span> has
				<i>led</i> the argument <i>into a contradiction</i> (by
			answering 'neither and both'), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				300d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαμφοτερίσας: τὸ ἀμφίβολον
				ποιῆσαι, καὶ τὸ δύο πραγμάτων ἐκπεσεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				347.7
			</span></i>.</div>
